{"id": "family-health-cross-session-001", "category": "family_long_memory", "session_id": "eval-family-health-cross-session-001-c36cf475", "answer": "", "tool_calls": [], "error": "HTTP 405: {\"detail\":\"Method Not Allowed\"}", "latency_ms": 5985.37, "turns": [{"response": "哎呀，头疼可不好受，您先别着急，找个安静的地方坐下来歇一歇，喝点温水。\n\n如果头疼得厉害，或者还伴有头晕、想吐这些情况，可别硬扛着，记得让家里人陪您去看看医生，或者打个电话给家人说一下。\n\n要是只是有点累，那就好好躺下休息一会儿，闭上眼睛缓一缓。我在这儿陪着您呢，有什么需要随时叫我。\n\n对了，您现在是在哪个城市呀？要是想出门透透气，我可以帮您看看天气合不合适。", "session_id": "eval-family-health-cross-session-001-c36cf475-grandma", "agent_type": "companion", "success": true, "tool_used": false, "tool_results": null, "command_type": null, "metadata": {"mode": "elder", "mode_source": "request", "processing_time": 5.97156, "message_count": 1, "timestamp": "2026-08-12T16:56:21.546514", "trace_id": "996f6726-43a7-4ee8-974d-4c74f958e4ce"}, "reminder": null}, {"response": "奶奶今天提到过头疼。这是健康情况记录，若症状持续或加重，建议尽快联系家人或医生。", "session_id": "eval-family-health-cross-session-001-c36cf475-father", "agent_type": "companion", "success": true, "tool_used": false, "tool_results": [], "command_type": null, "metadata": {"mode": "elder", "mode_source": "request", "processing_time": 0.001423, "message_count": 1, "timestamp": "2026-08-12T16:56:21.551691", "trace_id": "a317d1ec-d25b-43a9-9bee-0b40ca0afdba"}, "reminder": null}]}
{"id": "family-health-multiple-members-002", "category": "family_long_memory", "session_id": "eval-family-health-multiple-members-002-86ef2fc7", "answer": "", "tool_calls": [], "error": "HTTP 405: {\"detail\":\"Method Not Allowed\"}", "latency_ms": 9233.23, "turns": [{"response": "听您说有点咳嗽，心里挂念着您呢。咳嗽的时候要多喝点温水润润嗓子，注意保暖别受凉。如果咳嗽一直不好或者感觉胸闷气短、呼吸不舒服，一定要及时联系家人或者去医院看看。您先好好休息，有什么需要随时叫我。", "session_id": "eval-family-health-multiple-members-002-86ef2fc7-grandma", "agent_type": "companion", "success": true, "tool_used": false, "tool_results": null, "command_type": null, "metadata": {"mode": "elder", "mode_source": "request", "processing_time": 4.284912, "message_count": 1, "timestamp": "2026-08-12T16:56:25.841131", "trace_id": "08b6e432-bf04-4e8e-a57b-ea37dfea0983"}, "reminder": null}, {"response": "爷爷您好。头晕可别大意了。\n\n建议您先坐下来休息一会儿，喝点温水，不要急着走动。如果头晕比较厉害，或者伴有恶心、看东西转圈、手脚发麻这些情况，请一定马上联系家人或者拨打120。\n\n要是您方便的话，可以告诉我您现在在哪个城市，我帮您看看天气适不适合开窗透透气。您也要记得按时量血压哦。\n\n有不舒服一定第一时间叫家人陪着您。", "session_id": "eval-family-health-multiple-members-002-86ef2fc7-grandpa", "agent_type": "companion", "success": true, "tool_used": false, "tool_results": null, "command_type": null, "metadata": {"mode": "elder", "mode_source": "request", "processing_time": 4.936786, "message_count": 1, "timestamp": "2026-08-12T16:56:30.780780", "trace_id": "e55d4f27-b234-4dd3-ac6d-8dfc96fd6b37"}, "reminder": null}, {"response": "奶奶今天提到过咳嗽。这是健康情况记录，若症状持续或加重，建议尽快联系家人或医生。", "session_id": "eval-family-health-multiple-members-002-86ef2fc7-father", "agent_type": "companion", "success": true, "tool_used": false, "tool_results": [], "command_type": null, "metadata": {"mode": "elder", "mode_source": "request", "processing_time": 0.00116, "message_count": 1, "timestamp": "2026-08-12T16:56:30.785374", "trace_id": "e2cfe97f-fe38-4406-9feb-f764d984043b"}, "reminder": null}]}
{"id": "family-health-recall-by-grandchild-003", "category": "family_long_memory", "session_id": "eval-family-health-recall-by-grandchild-003-794dec20", "answer": "", "tool_calls": [], "error": "HTTP 405: {\"detail\":\"Method Not Allowed\"}", "latency_ms": 4996.78, "turns": [{"response": "听到您腿疼，我心里也惦记着您。腿疼这两天是不是走路多了，或者天气变化引起的呢？\n\n给您几点小提醒：\n\n第一，尽量多休息，别让腿太劳累。\n\n第二，可以用热毛巾敷一敷疼的地方，会舒服一些。\n\n第三，如果疼得厉害，或者腿肿了、走不动路，一定要及时告诉家人，或者去医院看看。\n\n您方便告诉我您的名字吗？我帮您把情况记下来，也好提醒家人多照顾您。要是疼得厉害，可别硬撑着呀。", "session_id": "eval-family-health-recall-by-grandchild-003-794dec20-grandma", "agent_type": "companion", "success": true, "tool_used": false, "tool_results": null, "command_type": null, "metadata": {"mode": "elder", "mode_source": "request", "processing_time": 4.987859, "message_count": 1, "timestamp": "2026-08-12T16:56:35.777268", "trace_id": "7c350930-e8ce-487d-923c-41a9be08d104"}, "reminder": null}, {"response": "外婆今天提到过腿疼。这是健康情况记录，若症状持续或加重，建议尽快联系家人或医生。", "session_id": "eval-family-health-recall-by-grandchild-003-794dec20-child", "agent_type": "companion", "success": true, "tool_used": false, "tool_results": [], "command_type": null, "metadata": {"mode": "elder", "mode_source": "request", "processing_time": 0.001356, "message_count": 1, "timestamp": "2026-08-12T16:56:35.782289", "trace_id": "2333da2b-0bf9-4c1a-a17a-721781b48d1b"}, "reminder": null}]}
